    },
    "bg": "00010",
    "bgm": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1004001020010,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "うん、ついにこの時がきたんやね～\r\nいやー、うち、わくわくするばい！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100400102/1004001020010"
  },
  {
    "id": 1004001020020,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "近いうちにユニットのアンティーカも本格的に動きだすし\r\nうち、ホントにアイドルになれたっちゃね……",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100400102/1004001020020"
  },
  {
    "id": 1004001020030,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "よーし！\r\n今日は特に気合いれてくけん、見とってね～！",
    "charAnim1": "smile4",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100400102/1004001020030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "おお、その意気だぞ！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それじゃあ、最後の確認をしておこう\r\n今回のキャンペーンガールの仕事だけど……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1004001020040,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "わかっとるよ～、キャンペーンガールって\r\nようは商品をよろしくっていう看板娘のことっちゃろ～？",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100400102/1004001020040"
  },
  {
    "id": 1004001020050,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "うち、実家の定食屋でもよく褒められとったけん\r\n宣伝とかはバッチリたい！",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100400102/1004001020050"
  },
  {
    "id": 1004001020060,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "看板娘をやらしてうちの右にでるもんはおらんばい！\r\nまかせとって！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100400102/1004001020060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（すごい……初仕事なのにまったく緊張がないな……\r\nこれは期待できる！）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "じゃあ、頼んだぞ。恋鐘\r\n頑張ってこい",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1004001020070,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "はーい、いってくるばい！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100400102/1004001020070"
  },
  {
    "effectLabel": "black1",
    "effectTarget": {
      "type": "rect",
      "width": 1136,
      "height": 640,
      "color": "000000"
    },
    "effectValue": {
      "type": "from",
      "x": 1000,
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 1000
    }
  },
  {
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2000
  },
  {
    "effectLabel": "black1",
    "effectValue": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 240
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1004001020080,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "みんなちょっと見てって～！\r\n今からばりすごかもん紹介するから見てって～！",
    "charAnim1": "smile3",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100400102/1004001020080"
  },
  {
    "id": 1004001020090,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "はーい、みんな足ば止めてくれて、ありがと～\r\n今からトークショー始まるけん待っとってね～",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100400102/1004001020090"
  },
  {
    "id": 1004001020100,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "……うん！　じゃあ、けっこう人も集まってくれとーけん\r\nさっそく、イベント始めていくばい～！",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100400102/1004001020100"
  },
  {
    "id": 1004001020110,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "今日のキャンペーンイベントで紹介するのはこれ！\r\nこれがまたばりすごくて……え？",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100400102/1004001020110"
  },
  {
    "id": 1004001020120,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "あ！　そっかまず会社の名前言わんとね！\r\nいや、うっかりしとったよ～！　えーっと……名前名前……",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100400102/1004001020120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（あ、あれ……？　恋鐘……？\r\nさっきはあんなに自信満々だったのに……）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1004001020130,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "……それで、お！　次はなんと、この商品の開発者の人が\r\n直接効果の説明ばしてくれるよ～！",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100400102/1004001020130"
  },
  {
    "id": 1004001020140,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "では、開発主任田中さん！　どうぞー！",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100400102/1004001020140"
  },
  {
    "id": 1004001020150,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "ん？…………え？　名前が違う？　中田さん？\r\nええ～！？",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100400102/1004001020150"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（……やる気が空回りしてしまっているみたいだな）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "se": "0148"
  },
  {
    "effectLabel": "black2",
    "effectTarget": {
      "type": "rect",
