    "text": "（次の仕事もこの調子でいこう、恋鐘）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "nextLabel": "end"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "一度段取りを確認しておこう",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1004001020250,
    "label": "2",
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "え？　さっきスタッフさんと一回確認したとよ～？",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100400102/1004001020250"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "念のため、最後の確認だよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1004001020260,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "んー確かに、足場をしっかり固めておくのは\r\n大事やもんね～！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100400102/1004001020260"
  },
  {
    "id": 1004001020270,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "休憩中にもう一回最後の見直しせんばね！\r\nプロデューサー、手伝ってくれんかいな～？",
    "charAnim1": "smile3",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100400102/1004001020270"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いいとも\r\nそれじゃあ、後半の頭から確認してみようか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "off",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textFrame": "off",
